/* =====================================================================
   Builder
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   Four ways to build, one visual language.

     compose   Windows · Pieces · Product UI
               Twelve layouts. The layout supplies the composition; the
               preset supplies the style; the slots supply the art.
     device    A device is a frame with a screen. Anything the compose
               engine makes can go inside it.

   The split between STYLE + primitives and LAYOUTS is the whole design.
   Monotony comes from reusing a layout; family coherence comes from
   reusing the language. Change a number in GEO and all twelve move.

   Every coordinate was copied from the product illustration generator
   exploration, not re-derived. This style is sub-pixel geometry: a
   stroke of 1 where a preset says 0.5 is visibly wrong, so nothing in
   GEO is a judgment call to revisit while adding a layout.

   Glyphs are Expressive Assets System Icons, filled, on a 24 unit grid.
   The forty the layouts and the starter set need are baked in so the
   page draws before any fetch; everything else in the collection comes
   from manifest.json on demand.
   ===================================================================== */

